        "en": "Supportive and friendly neighborhood veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Harlem pet owners frequently praise Dr. Sola, Dr. Youssef, and the clinic staff for compassionate, patient bedside care. Long-time clients appreciate that doctors remember their pets and take time to answer questions during routine checkups. Only isolated reviews criticize staff interactions, citing disputes with nursing staff or diagnostic follow-up."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for rescues and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the veterinary team's patient and considerate approach with nervous dogs, rescue animals, and bully breeds. Attending staff respect canine stress limits during ear treatments and intake procedures, allowing animals time to decompress while ensuring comfortable wellness checkups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed evaluations of clinic treatment fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Opinions on pricing vary substantially among clients. Several pet owners consider costs reasonable compared to other Manhattan practices and appreciate itemized treatment estimates. However, other reviewers express frustration over repetitive diagnostic examination charges on booster vaccine visits and high overall treatment quotes."
      }
    }
  ],
